        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2a. Greater knowledge of pre-Columbian civilizations and the effect of European colonization destroying their societies by inflicting on them devastating diseases has led to a historical reassessment of Columbus's role in world history.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
