            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "✓ 2b.  $ \\underline{\\text{Historians are reassessing Columbus's role in world history}} $ because they know more about pre-Columbian civilizations and how European colonization destroyed their societies by inflicting on them devastating diseases.",
            "block_bbox": [
