        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In 2a, the point of the sentence is buried at its end. In 2b, the sentence's opening clause states the main point, its most important claim: Historians are reassessing Columbus's role in world history. That claim is then supported by the longer and more complex clause that follows.",
